id: zoom-dtap-column
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: T-643: a double tap on a narrow column of a desktop-width page zooms to the column (chosen by its computed display), and the column stays under the finger
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-dtap.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R5
wait rect 'sel:#col' 30
calibrate 'sel:h1'
dtap 512 420
wait zoom 10
wait settled 6
expect zoom-min 1.5
expect element-at 'sel:#col' 384 420
expect content 0,100,756,700 'sel:#col'
